// Bio Weapons Pack: six living weapons (green, organic), three front, three rear,
// eleven power levels each like the original weapons (front[] / rear[], MODDING.md 5.3).
//
// Shop icons: 24x28, built by utils/bio_weapons_art.py from original shop icons
// (data/reference/sprites/pickups/weapons/): the metal gun housing is kept, the core
// becomes a glowing green sac, plates turn to carapace or bone; rim and two-step drop
// shadow redrawn by utils/mod_art_clean.py. Shots: 12x14, four frames each, drawn by
// the same script through utils/mod_shot_draw.py. The frames <name>_1..4 get
// consecutive sprite slots (PNGs are numbered in name order), so "animation": 3
// cycles all four.
//
// Balance (README, utils/mod_weapon_balance.py): damage per second = salvo damage
// x 35 / (fire_delay + 1), compared at every level with the original weapons of
// the same price. POSITIVE speed_y = upward; sub_delay 255 = the shot lives until
// it leaves the screen (MODDING.md 5.4). The source of this file is generated:
// keep the level tables and the README tables in step (docs/mod-art-pipeline.md).
